      "Title": "Dangerous Animal",
      "Description": "Call 911 to report an animal causing a dangerous or hazardous condition.",
      "Section": [
        {
          "Name": "911 Dangerous Animal",
          "Content": "<style type=\"text/css\">.divTable {\n                display: table;\n                width: 100%;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.divTableRow {\n                display: table-row;\n}\n.divTableCell1, .divTableHead {\n                border: 0px solid #cccccc;\n                display: table-cell;\n                padding: 6px 12px;\n                background-color: red;\n                color: white;\n                font-weight: bold;\n                text-align: center;\n}\n.divTableCell2, .divTableHead {\n                border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n                display: table-cell;\n                padding: 12px 12px;\n                background-color: #eeeeee;\n}\n.divTableBody {\n                display: table-row-group;\n}</style><div class=\"divTable\"><div class=\"divTableBody\"><div class=\"divTableRow\"><div class=\"divTableCell1\">Call 911</div></div><div class=\"divTableRow\"><div class=\"divTableCell2\">Call <span style=\"color:#FF0004\"><strong>911</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></strong>to report animals that are currently threatening or endangering people.<p><br />This includes animals that are:</p><ul><li>Aggressive</li><li>Ferocious</li><li>Vicious</li><li>Foaming at the mouth</li><li>Showing signs of rabies</li></ul><p>Do <strong>not </strong>call 911 to file a complaint about animals that have bitten other animals.</p></div></div></div></div>",
          "ContentAction": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}